{"unit_id":"ymck-x__dsh-skill-starter#card-zh","repo":"ymck-x/dsh-skill-starter","commit":"5592d35b235a4460479854f9b20bcda39a5ca105","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-starter 是面向 DSH Web 设置页的技能管理插件。它注册随包提供的基础技能，并在设置页提供技能管理面板，同时让模型可在对话中列出、读取、创建、修改和删除技能，也可查看或安装技能包。用户可以编辑技能说明与正文、设定模型和手动调用方式，并把内置技能复制到用户目录；附带的 engineering-zh 包包含 20 个中文工程流程技能。适合希望管理可复用指令、保存个人工作流程或为 DSH 添加工程方法的用户。无需 API key 或外部服务；用户创建的技能保存在本机 DSH 技能目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1046-1063","index.js:1072-1109","client.js:627-640","packs/engineering-zh/pack.json:19-40"]}
{"unit_id":"ymck-x__dsh-skill-starter#card-en","repo":"ymck-x/dsh-skill-starter","commit":"5592d35b235a4460479854f9b20bcda39a5ca105","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-starter adds skill management to DSH Web settings and chat. It registers bundled skills and lets the model list, read, edit, create, and delete skills, or install skill packs. Users can copy built-in skills. The engineering-zh pack contains 20 Chinese workflow skills. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1046-1063","index.js:1072-1109","client.js:627-640","packs/engineering-zh/pack.json:19-40"]}
